msgid "#PluralForms"
msgstr "nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/fractal_cn_common"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, and "
"other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/fractal_cn_epic"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, "
"customization elements, and other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/fractal_cn_rare"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these boxes may grant you vehicles, in-game currencies, "
"customization elements, and other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/fractal_cn_common"
msgstr ""
"Can be obtained from the in-game Store and received when opening boxes of "
"any other kind."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/fractal_cn_epic"
msgstr "Can be received while opening boxes of any other kind."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/fractal_cn_rare"
msgstr "Can be received while opening boxes of any other kind."

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/fractal_cn_common"
msgstr "Celestial Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/fractal_cn_epic"
msgstr "Chosen Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/fractal_cn_rare"
msgstr "Heaven Help Lootbox"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/fractal_cn_common"
msgstr "CELESTIAL LOOTBOX"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/fractal_cn_epic"
msgstr "CHOSEN LOOTBOX"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/fractal_cn_rare"
msgstr "HEAVEN HELP LOOTBOX"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special boxes containing new and unique items. They can be "
"obtained from the in-game Store."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/timerText"
msgstr "The event will end in"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "God's Blessing"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "GOD'S BLESSING"

msgid "guaranteed/tooltip/description1/"
msgstr ""
"If all vehicles are already owned, you receive a Chosen Lootbox instead."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all the vehicles from the boxes, you will receive a "
"Chosen Lootbox as a reward instead of a vehicle."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s Celestial, %(guaranteed1)s Heaven Help, and "
"%(guaranteed2)s Chosen Lootboxes are guaranteed to contain a vehicle. If you"
" open them without one dropping such a vehicle, then a vehicle you do not "
"already own will drop when you open the "
"%(guaranteed0)sth/%(guaranteed1)sth/%(guaranteed2)sth box (depending on the "
"box type). When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "infoPage/footer/title/compensation"
msgstr "Compensation"

msgid "infoPage/footer/title/guaranteed"
msgstr "Guaranteed Reward"

msgid "infoPage/header/rewards/description"
msgstr "No more than one reward per group can drop"
